* Silver Dragon Scales Mail (Ref)
POOR MAN'S CHOICE: Get Mithril Coat if you can (MC3 and it's still
quite light)

CLOAKS (looks like the only choices are the MC3 ones)
* Oilskin Cloak (MC3, prevents grabbing)
* Cloak of Magic Resistance (MC3 and, obviously, MR)
* Elven Cloak (MC3, stealth)
* Robe (MC3, Helps spellcasting)
* Cloak of Protection (MC3)
POOR MAN'S CHOICES: If you don't need MC3, there are some nice options
* Cloak of Displacement
* Cloak of Invisibility
* Alchemy Smock (nice early, poison and acid resistance)

SHIELD (if not two-weaponing)
* Shield of Reflection (Ref) is the obvious choice here
POOR MAN'S CHOICE: Elven Shield (nice for AC and spell-casting, but
fragile)

